              </a>
          </div>
    <div class="grid-col-10 info">
    <h4>
              <a href="/faqs/what-are-tsunamis">
        <span class="usa-sr-only usgs-screenreader-only">  What are tsunamis?
</span>
                What are tsunamis?

              </a>
          </h4>
    <div class="field--name--field-intro">
      
<div class="field field--name--field-content field--type--entity-reference-revisions field--label--hidden node--view-mode--list">
  
          <div  class="field-content field-loop-count-1 field-first field-last">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--wysiwyg-text-with-media paragraph--view-mode--list">
          
<div class="field field--name--field-text-with-media field--type--text-long field--label--hidden">
    
      <div  class="field-text-with-media">  <div class="tex2jax_process"><p>Tsunamis are ocean waves triggered by: Large earthquakes that occur near or under the ocean Volcanic eruptions Submarine landslides Onshore landslides in which large volumes of debris fall into the water Scientists do not use the term "tidal wave" because these waves are not caused by tides. Tsunami waves are unlike typical ocean waves generated by wind and storms, and most tsunamis do not "break"...</p></div>

</div>
  
</div>

      </div>
</div>
  
</div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>



  
<div class="faq-mobile">
